{"unit_id":"lrxG__dsh-app#card-zh","repo":"lrxG/dsh-app","commit":"062df125cfcc2ba3c48269c626c38de3be9d2b9f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lanbuddy-pair 是一个面向网页端 DSH 的扫码配对插件，可让手机连接电脑当前运行的 DSH 实例。它在设置页加入「扫码配对」界面，展示由当前认证地址生成的二维码和连接信息；当 DSH 只监听本机回环地址时，还会启动局域网网关并转发 HTTP 与 WebSocket 请求。用户可在浏览器查看配对页或二维码，也可撤销所有已配对设备。适合希望从手机访问电脑 DSH 的用户；需要手机和电脑通过局域网互通，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:65-183","lib/index.js:119-272","lib/gateway.js:40-114"]}
{"unit_id":"lrxG__dsh-app#card-en","repo":"lrxG/dsh-app","commit":"062df125cfcc2ba3c48269c626c38de3be9d2b9f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-lanbuddy-pair adds QR pairing to DSH Settings so a phone can connect to a computer running DSH. It uses the current authenticated address and starts a LAN gateway for loopback instances, forwarding HTTP and WebSocket traffic. Users can open a pairing page and revoke devices.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:65-183","lib/index.js:119-272","lib/gateway.js:40-114"]}
