{"unit_id":"lrxG__dsh-app#feature-1","repo":"lrxG/dsh-app","commit":"062df125cfcc2ba3c48269c626c38de3be9d2b9f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lanbuddy-pair 的功能「设置页扫码配对」：在 DSH 设置中添加扫码配对面板，读取当前连接地址并显示二维码；用户用手机扫描即可取得可访问的实例地址。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:116-176","lib/index.js:176-220"]}
{"unit_id":"lrxG__dsh-app#feature-2","repo":"lrxG/dsh-app","commit":"062df125cfcc2ba3c48269c626c38de3be9d2b9f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lanbuddy-pair 的功能「回环实例局域网转发」：当 DSH 仅监听本机回环地址时，自动尝试在局域网地址开放网关，并将 HTTP 与 WebSocket 请求转发到本地服务。端口占用时会依次尝试后续端口。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:119-160","lib/gateway.js:40-114"]}
{"unit_id":"lrxG__dsh-app#feature-3","repo":"lrxG/dsh-app","commit":"062df125cfcc2ba3c48269c626c38de3be9d2b9f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lanbuddy-pair 的功能「撤销配对设备」：用户在设置页点击解除所有设备，插件删除浏览器会话凭据记录；需要重启 DSH 才会让新签名密钥生效。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:87-113","lib/index.js:246-270"]}
{"unit_id":"lrxG__dsh-app#caveat-1","repo":"lrxG/dsh-app","commit":"062df125cfcc2ba3c48269c626c38de3be9d2b9f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lanbuddy-pair 使用回环实例时会在局域网地址启动转发网关，默认从 3080 端口开始尝试；可通过配置关闭或调整绑定地址与端口。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:119-124","lib/gateway.js:93-112"]}
